silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_03_sections_02_concrete_anchor_2#bodymassvalue4_3kg silm:hasLongDescription "The BodyMassValue4_3kg is the 4.3 kg reading from 2026-04-12. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Value_1', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
